 from Boston's past as you learn about the history of the area from a longtime resident, passionate historian, and former city employee. The tour includes a short walk through historic Little Italy that takes a detour from the Freedom Trail to explore this historical neighborhood.\n\nEnjoy free time for a delicious lunch in an artisanal farm-to-table market or the oldest restaurant in America.\n\n##Included\nTour guide services only\n\n##Not Included\nGratuities\n\n##What to bring\nComfortable Clothes & Shoes", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "", "booking_notes": "", "cancellation_notes": "- You will receive a full refund if you cancel at least 14 days before your tour \n- You will receive a 50% refund if you cancel at least 7 days before your tour\n- No refunds within 7 days, but we will give you a 50% off coupon to book a new slot", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "For all ages! • 4.5 Hours • Starting at $400 • Private tour • Up to 15 people", "short_description": "", "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/bostonhiddengems/items/426001/images/869895/", "pk": 869895, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/oehLSREgQMm326UYQcRO", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/oehLSREgQMm326UYQcRO", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/bostonhiddengems/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/bostonhiddengems/items/426001/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/oehLSREgQMm326UYQcRO", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/oehLSREgQMm326UYQcRO", "is_low_resolution": false, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}, {"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/bostonhiddengems/items/426001/images/869896/", "pk": 869896, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.